WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:01.620
- Bacon my favorite. I ain't gonna lie.

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.020
Buckeye's be hitting though.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:05.970
What's up? Its your boy C.J.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:07.410
Out here with bleacher report.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.390
Usually y'all see me on Saturdays here,

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:11.190
On back, looking at tailgates,

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:13.268
having a good time and
supporting my Buckeyes.

00:00:13.268 --> 00:00:16.018
(crowd cheering)

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.060
I miss being at Columbus,

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.250
everybody so nice and welcoming.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.930
So got a lot of love out here for people.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:22.890
I appreciate it.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.320
It's a lemonade so, you know,

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.550
first bite of some fire.

00:00:30.279 --> 00:00:31.590
Buckeyes be hitting though, for real.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:32.423
What time is it?

00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:33.467
Nine in the morning?

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:35.490
[Tailgater] - It's 10:14.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.410
- Ah, ain't no barbecue at no 10:14.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:38.880
But it looks good though.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:42.120
It's cool man. It's not
something I would want to do.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.539
I wanna go play.

00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:44.533
(C.J. laughs)

00:00:44.533 --> 00:00:45.390
- This is for noon game

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:47.280
so when it's like you
need a good breakfast.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.113
- Okay, thank you

00:00:48.113 --> 00:00:49.740
'cause I went to another spot

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:50.674
and they have barbecue.

00:00:50.674 --> 00:00:51.599
- Yeah. Like not it yet.

00:00:51.599 --> 00:00:54.360
- Nobody's eating barbecue,
you know what I'm saying?

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.010
- You can have just bacon.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:57.900
- Bacon my favorite. I ain't gonna lie.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.659
- [2nd Tailgater] Got
it from this farm too.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.393
- For real? I need to talk to you.

00:01:01.393 --> 00:01:04.833
I'm trying to have a farm
in these next couple years.

00:01:07.291 --> 00:01:08.310
(crowd cheering)

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:09.453
He caught that easy.

00:01:09.453 --> 00:01:10.680
(C.J. laughs)

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.832
We gonna mess up the recruitment.

00:01:12.832 --> 00:01:13.665
Nah.

00:01:13.665 --> 00:01:14.580
- It was my unofficial visit,

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.500
my first time at Ohio State.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.140
October 5th, my birthday weekend.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:20.340
I flew from the game

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:22.170
and I flew with my ankle tape on.

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:23.280
So it's kind of a crazy story.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:27.390
Like I got to the team hotel
and I asked for scissors

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:29.490
because I had to cut my
ankle tape off from the game.

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:31.200
So, nah, that's good memories, man.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:32.970
That was my first time ever in Columbus.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:35.250
Q was the alley-oop guy, for sure.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.814
They owe Q a lot of money.

00:01:36.814 --> 00:01:37.800
(Q laughs)

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.691
Talk me through it, little bro.

00:01:39.691 --> 00:01:41.239
- So, I didn't really set it up.

00:01:41.239 --> 00:01:42.072
- Okay.

00:01:42.072 --> 00:01:42.905
- But I know someone that did.

00:01:42.905 --> 00:01:43.800
- What you got yourselves?

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.990
Some brisket? That's
brisket right there? Okay.

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:47.805
- These wings are unbelievable.

00:01:47.805 --> 00:01:48.750
- Oh okay.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:49.950
When do y'all prepare all this food?

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:51.360
The night before or this morning?

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:52.193
- This Morning.

00:01:52.193 --> 00:01:53.790
- This morning. Wow.
You gotta get up early.

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:57.060
- Yeah were here about six o'clock, 5:30.

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:57.893
- Wow.

00:01:57.893 --> 00:02:00.410
My preference of a tailgate?

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:01.243
I don't know.

00:02:01.243 --> 00:02:03.990
I feel like I like this type of stuff

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.460
but I couldn't eat any
of this in the morning,

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:07.620
so I would prefer like more breakfast.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:09.983
But like a night game,
this one would be perfect.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:14.265
How's everything going?
It's good to see you.

00:02:14.265 --> 00:02:15.273
What's up bud?

00:02:15.273 --> 00:02:16.732
Good to see you, bro. How you been?

00:02:16.732 --> 00:02:17.565
- Good.

00:02:17.565 --> 00:02:18.631
- I miss y'all, man. Is your brother here?

00:02:18.631 --> 00:02:19.464
- Ah no.

00:02:19.464 --> 00:02:21.130
- He didn't make it?
- Yeah

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:21.963
- He gonna be mad.
- Yeah.

00:02:21.963 --> 00:02:22.796
- It's Juicy, right here.

00:02:22.796 --> 00:02:25.789
Everybody meet my guy, Juicy.

00:02:25.789 --> 00:02:27.273
- [Crowd Member] Thank you so much.

00:02:27.273 --> 00:02:28.770
- Love you, bro.

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:29.730
How you balling?

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:32.820
Man, I've been out of this
tunnel a thousand times.

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:35.880
First one as like a
spectator, so I miss playing

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.473
but you know, support my guys.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.290
What's up with you?

00:02:40.721 --> 00:02:44.095
(crowd talking)

00:02:44.095 --> 00:02:46.170
- Man, I'm so fucking proud
of you. I miss you, man.

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.073
- Ahh.

00:02:47.073 --> 00:02:47.906
(both laughing)

00:02:47.906 --> 00:02:50.082
that man, the myth, the legend.

00:02:50.082 --> 00:02:50.915
- JuJu.

00:02:50.915 --> 00:02:52.482
- How you doing, brother.
- JuJu.

00:02:52.482 --> 00:02:53.507
- Snakie.

00:02:53.507 --> 00:02:54.373
- Hello, baby.

00:02:54.373 --> 00:02:55.498
- Love you, bro.

00:02:55.498 --> 00:02:56.331
Kid X.

00:02:57.232 --> 00:02:58.065
- How you doing man?

00:02:58.065 --> 00:02:58.898
- Okay-zy, bro.

00:02:58.898 --> 00:03:01.565
(crowd talking)

00:03:03.006 --> 00:03:03.839
Good to see you, man.

00:03:03.839 --> 00:03:04.672
- Thank you.
- How you doing, man?

00:03:04.672 --> 00:03:06.187
- Hey, how are you, man?

00:03:06.187 --> 00:03:07.645
- Good to see you, man. Thanks, man.

00:03:07.645 --> 00:03:09.960
- Thank you. Thank you
for sorting that out.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.790
- So man, I'm going with the Buckeyes.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:12.623
I think we'll come out

00:03:12.623 --> 00:03:13.693
and win this thing a little early, man.

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:15.330
I definitely think our defense

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.190
is gonna maybe even go with a shutout,

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:19.244
so I'm definitely going
with the Buckeyes, man.

00:03:19.244 --> 00:03:22.994
(crowd cheering and booing)

00:03:28.477 --> 00:03:29.944
Yeah, go ahead. Boo.

00:03:29.944 --> 00:03:31.200
(C.J. laughs)

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.340
Nah, it feels good though, man.

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:33.660
To be back home.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:35.250
See all my brothers.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.200
Man, it's blessing.

